[statement]
A provider a `!` dependency forbids is passed over for the next: `app`
needs `v` and forbids `p1`, the higher ranked provider, and `p2` is chosen.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v !p1

P:p1
V:1
p:v=1
k:100

P:p2
V:1
p:v=1
k:10

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p2 1
install app 1
